│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ modular_lpt_pipeline                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Restructure the algorithm as an explicit pipeline of independent, modular stages          │
│                          │ (`NodePacker`, `ExpertReplicator`, `GpuPacker`) orchestrated by a `RebalancePipeline`     │
│                          │ class. Each stage is decoupled: it receives immutable inputs and produces outputs,        │
│                          │ improving maintainability and allowing each stage to use the best-suited implementation.  │
│                          │ Key performance changes: (1) balanced_packing uses LPT with a per-pack capacity counter   │
│                          │ and heap, processing layers with pre-extracted Python lists to avoid tensor indexing      │
│                          │ overhead; (2) replicate_experts is rewritten with an iterative batched refinement that    │
│                          │ replicates greedily by per-replica load (weight/count), and (3) the final map             │
│                          │ construction uses a single scatter with flattened precomputed index tensors. The stage    │
│                          │ boundaries also make the global-vs-hierarchical policy selection a simple pipeline        │
│                          │ configuration rather than duplicated call paths.                                          │
